  "description": "Your confidence‑boosting cruiser: a super‑low step‑through makes getting on and off feel effortless, especially if you’re new to e‑bikes or getting back into riding after a break. It keeps you upright and relaxed, more like sitting in a comfy chair than leaning over a sporty bike, so neighborhood rides and errands feel easy instead of intimidating. The electric assist quietly takes the edge off hills and headwinds, helping you ride farther than you thought you could without breaking a sweat. Pedego e‑bikes use safe and reliable battery packs certified to UL 2271, and the complete system meets UL 2849 standards, the gold standard for electrical and fire safety, because you and your family deserve peace of mind on every ride. While many e‑bike brands skip this step, Pedego puts safety first so your only job is to enjoy the ride.",
